 a deity of the Avvites"},"H8661":{"lemma":"תַּרְתָּן","xlit":"Tartân","gloss":"Tartan.","def":"Tartan, an Assyrian"},"H8640":{"lemma":"תִּרְהָקָה","xlit":"Tirhâqâh","gloss":"Tirhakah.","def":"Tirhakah, a king of Kush"},"H8616":{"lemma":"תִּקְוָה","xlit":"Tiqvâh","gloss":"Tikvah.","def":"Tikvah, the name of two Israelites"},"H8612":{"lemma":"תֹּפֶת","xlit":"Tôpheth","gloss":"Tophet, Topheth.","def":"Topheth, a place near Jerusalem"},"H8638":{"lemma":"תִּרְגַּם","xlit":"tirgam","gloss":"interpret.","def":"to transfer, i.e. translate"},"H8624":{"lemma":"תַּקִּיף","xlit":"taqqîyph","gloss":"mighty, strong.","def":"{powerful}"},"H8648":{"lemma":"תְּרֵין","xlit":"tᵉrêyn","gloss":"second, [phrase] twelve, two.","def":"two"},"H8674":{"lemma":"תַּתְּנַי","xlit":"Tattᵉnay","gloss":"Tatnai.","def":"Tattenai, a Persian"},"H8652":{"lemma":"תָּרָע","xlit":"târâʻ","gloss":"porter.","def":"a doorkeeper"},"H8660":{"lemma":"תִּרְשָׁתָא","xlit":"Tirshâthâʼ","gloss":"Tirshatha.","def":"Tirshatha, the title of a Persian deputy or governor"},"H8657":{"lemma":"תֶּרֶשׁ","xlit":"Teresh","gloss":"Teresh.","def":"Teresh, a eunuch of Xerxes"},"H8633":{"lemma":"תֹּקֶף","xlit":"tôqeph","gloss":"authority, power, strength.","def":"might or (figuratively) positiveness"},"H8602":{"lemma":"תָּפֵל","xlit":"tâphêl","gloss":"foolish things, unsavoury, untempered.","def":"plaster (as gummy) or slime; (figuratively) frivolity"},"H8630":{"lemma":"תָּקַף","xlit":"tâqaph","gloss":"prevail (against).","def":"to overpower"},"H8611":{"lemma":"תֹּפֶת","xlit":"tôpheth","gloss":"tabret.","def":"a smiting, i.e. (figuratively) contempt"},"H8663":{"lemma":"תְּשֻׁאָה","xlit":"tᵉshuʼâh","gloss":"crying, noise, shouting, stir.","def":"a crashing or loud clamor"},"H8649":{"lemma":"תׇּרְמָה","xlit":"tormâh","gloss":"deceit(-ful), privily.","def":"fraud"},"H8629":{"lemma":"תֵּקַע","xlit":"têqaʻ","gloss":"sound.","def":"a blast of a trumpet"},"H8626":{"lemma":"תָּקַן","xlit":"tâqan","gloss":"set in order, make straight.",